Package: fly
Title: Historic Airphoto Footprints, Selection and Georeferencing for
    British Columbia
Version: 0.24.0
Date: 2026-10-08
Authors@R: c(
    person("Allan", "Irvine", , "al@newgraphenvironment.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3495-2128",
                       affiliation = "New Graph Environment Ltd.")),
    person("New Graph Environment Ltd.", role = c("cph", "fnd"))
    )
Description: Estimate the ground a historic British Columbia airphoto
    covers from its catalogue record; given an elevation model, a film
    photo can be sized from the aircraft's height above the ground, with
    the catalogued flying height checked against the photo scale. Select a
    small set of photos covering an area of interest, download scans and
    flight metadata from the BC Data Catalogue, and
    georeference scans onto their estimated footprints.
